-- Within the scale: a ceiling admits the ceiling itself and less, and refuses more; a fee is a fixed sum.
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 1 imprisonment 180 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 1 imprisonment 181 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 6 fine 5000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 6 fine 5001 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 6 `expiation fee` 315 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 6 `expiation fee` 300 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a proposed penalty is within the standard scale` 9 imprisonment 1 EQUALS NOTHING
